# Managed line-ending normalization (Owner directive 2026-07-23).
# LF everywhere in the repo; CRLF only for genuinely-Windows file types.
# Overrides each machine's core.autocrlf so endings are deterministic on
# Mac and Windows with no per-machine config.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
